Z||000000||bnedady||06-05-99||10:05 AM||||since you guys have talked about other drivers making body mods to your fieros, I have a story for u guys. Last Nov. my buddy loaned me one of his fieros while I was  doing some work on my 87 GT, both the cars were parked in the front yard when one afternoon I heard a very loud tire squeal that just seemed to get  closer and closer, then I hear BANG BANG, what I saw was a mustang in my driveway, both the fieros had moved over 6 feet, all 3 cars in a million pieces all over the yard and all 3 cars against each other like toy cars. Needless to say that nothing nice came out of my mouth. 2 months later my car was finally fixed, and the other fiero just got fixed yesterday. My fiero is now parked behind the house. This is proof that mudstains drivers are stupid, and can't drive worth a camel dung. Just wanted to share a bad (kinda funny now) experience.
